      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, make sense - so I think I slightly prefer to go with the current patch direction + warn + init  `hvcpu-\u003earch.xcr0/xss` to `kvm_host.xcr0/xss` (option 1) rather than injecting #GP (option 2). Injecting #GP, especially for xsetbv where there is no extable, will crash the host. Therefore with option 1 we will not crash the host and behave a bit like generic kvm. Does that make sense to you?",
